            "review_text": "Excursion18753920487\n1 contribution\n0\nAmazing experience with import beers\nMay 2026 • Family\n- Great restaurant, great service\nThis restaurant specializes in wine and beer, offering a luxurious blend of classic European and modern design. The beautiful wall paintings and soft music create an elegant yet relaxing atmosphere. \n\nThe menu is diverse, featuring a mix of Western and Vietnamese cuisine that pairs perfectly with the drinks. While soft drinks are limited, the restaurant offers an impressive selection of wines, beers, and fresh juices. \n\nThe staff are attentive and professional, making the dining experience even more enjoyable. Considering the high-quality food, drinks, and atmosphere, the average price of around $20 per person is quite reasonable for an upscale restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten May 3, 2026",
