            "review_text": "Curiosity45338994448\n3 contributions\n0\nHanoi trip with my friends\nDec 2025 • Friends\nwas invited here by my Vietnamese partners, and it turned out to be such a pleasant surprise. Mega Dunk Bistro feels almost like stepping into a European beer hall – wide selection of draft and imported bottled beers, lively atmosphere, and the kind of energy that makes you want to stay longer.\n\nEveryone at the table kept praising the place, and honestly, I get why. The food was tasty and went perfectly with the beers, and the whole evening had that same cheerful, communal vibe you’d find in Europe. Definitely a spot I’d come back to when I’m in Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten December 9, 2025",
